'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\01 - Preflight Check
' Version    : 3.3.0  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents 3.3.0)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAgents (BR_RunPreflight).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAgents > BR_RunPreflight):
'
' Checks environment + every DirSync candidate and writes
'   <AuditDir>\BulkReg_Preflight_<run>_audit.csv   (per-user status)
'   <AuditDir>\BulkReg_Preflight_<run>_debug.log
'   <AuditDir>\BulkReg_Preflight_<run>_mapping.txt      (users per mapping rule)
'   <AuditDir>\BulkReg_Preflight_<run>_mailfolders.txt  (folders to create, per server)
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' ### STEP A: paste the 3 lines below into (Options)
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAgents"
'#####################################################################
' ### STEP C: select Initialize and REPLACE its content with the 3 lines below
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunPreflight()
End Sub
